    {
      "name": "places/ChIJPScisMnzaS4RZRHXudFUW_k/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4SldVeE5hazAzWWt4YUxUbDBTWEZqZGt4elJXYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Tucked away in Pondok Bambu, this coffee spot feels like a cozy hidden gem.\n\nThe place might be small, but it’s packed with warmth and good vibes, perfect for a quick caffeine fix or a chill grab-and-go moment.\n\nTheir cappuccino is quite unique, it’s fruity and refreshing, perfect for those who love trying something new instead of the usual strong bitterness",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
