    {
      "name": "places/ChIJPScisMnzaS4RZRHXudFUW_k/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvNF9PUjF3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I really like the vibes and the environment of the cafe. Especially the sofa corner ones. However, if you go here for work, I doubt it will be ergonomic since the table heights are lower than the chair. For the food, the coffee is good, I ordered their cappuccino with less sugar and for the food I ordered shrimp menu (forgot the name). The shrimp menu was okay. I didn't get the chance to try their pastries, will try it later on.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
